From 32f3f772f193b179a6e1784fcd9000bce0eee48f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cognava <dev@samuhia.co.ke>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:19:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Samuhia Desk: brand, PWA, SEO and landing page

- Brand: Desk mark (cyan #06B6D4/#22D3EE, blue #2563EB, amber spark #D9993A on ink #0B1210),
  outlined lockups, app icon, maskable icons, favicon set, 1200x630 social image
  (brand/ + scripts/generate-brand.mjs, 'npm run brand')
- Apps/links: apple-touch, favicons, OG/Twitter tags with image size+alt, logo for JSON-LD
- PWA: single valid manifest.webmanifest (id, standalone, display_override, maskable split),
  viewport-fit=cover, solid status bar, dvh + safe-area base CSS, installed app opens to
  sign-in/dashboard, resilient service-worker precache
- Landing: fits any screen (dvh, clamp sizing, in-flow footer), no scrolling
- SEO: head fixed (stray div ended <head> early), JSON-LD graph (removed fake rating),
  canonical/hreflang, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, llms.txt, llms-full.txt, noindex headers
  for private routes, cache/content-type headers in firebase.json
